{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "0790ba5887e51cb8cfc4d6840391ed9a0012f3a871a0d9805ca3efbdac69d163", "ja": "爆誕！？　ジーマーでセツデンなバラエティ", "zh": "横空出世！？真个能省电的综艺节目", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c5a43f55fa727c84096a4554116973bc12d2c1506ddeb3529a484e6ed291c1f1", "ja": "社長の知り合いだという民放キー局の番組D\nからBOTとのコラボ特番の打診が！　今回の\nメンバーは紗代子、茜、恵美。第1回撮影\nは互いの好感度チェックという事で、お互い\nに関するクイズ。なんとか順調な滑り出し。", "zh": "据说是社长熟人的民营电视台关键台节目导演找上门来，希望与BOT合作拍摄特别节目！本次成员为纱代子、茜、惠美。第1次拍摄以互相了解好感度为主题，进行了关于彼此的问答环节。总算是开了个顺利的头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "a0acbce75ef72ecfc47c68261559fd5afa86d833c2cfeb30a6035a45de4bb8cc", "ja": "某月某日、撮影スタジオ……", "zh": "某月某日，摄影棚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f7ddff371667c24ec83912893e2c91bfedb0069d1510b3e7b48f0be1be1e3ffc", "ja": "（いよいよ、『BATTLE OF THEATER』の\n短期特番が始まる。今日は、その撮影第1回だ！）", "zh": "（终于要开始《BATTLE OF THEATER》的短期特别节目了。今天是第1次拍摄！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "202d913c32e0ce5a70208a988f9d626337eb6effceb14c9a8e1396213ee81077", "ja": "みなさん、こんにちは！　765プロ所属、アイドルの\n高山紗代子です！　今日はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "大家下午好！我是隶属于765事务所的偶像\n高山纱代子！今天请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "61d3859441bc9ac71249fbc3dee669a5bfdb168dc65d4afb990000eb2c630873", "ja": "同じく、野々原茜でーす♪\n茜ちゃん、って気軽に呼んでね！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "我也是，我是野野原茜～♪\n轻松地叫我小茜就好啦！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "5a684e314dd6754c2cd391e4170db263d2deb3b70e56d53fec3d84ce7f866dd8", "ja": "どもども、同じく所恵美でーす。好きなものは\nファミレスとカラオケ！　よろしく～♪", "zh": "嗨嗨，同样是所惠美哦。喜欢的东西是\n家庭餐厅和卡拉OK！请多关照～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1005_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "347217cf57f40ed33470601b18ed02e882e47712661a46889a5f7aaa940d599a", "ja": "……はい、ありがとうございます！\nというワケで、まずは自己紹介していただきました。", "zh": "……好的，非常感谢！\n那么，刚才首先请各位作了自我介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1006_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "d21e252632b458eedd1b0ab53bd54700ea742c08a4744bde9b85756fde3a3e6e", "ja": "皆さん、同じ765プロのアイドルですが……現在\n進行中の企画では、対抗する別々のチーム所属だとか？", "zh": "各位虽然都是同属765事务所的偶像……但在目前进行中的企划里，似乎分别属于彼此竞争的不同队伍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "aa83b8435b6f36b17f18d39ff60edd1c5148e75703f631796fc329488a563557", "ja": "そうそう！　茜ちゃんたち、基本的には仲良しだけど。\n戦わなきゃいけない運命なのだ……ライバルだからネ☆", "zh": "对对！虽然小茜她们基本上关系很好。\n但因为是对手，命中注定要战斗……☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1008_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "5e69603318959161b5ff32a5672dac6fb4133016a723535f71972f7abcd82454", "ja": "なるほど～。そのような状況を踏まえながらも、\n皆さんには楽しい時間を過ごしていただきつつ……。", "zh": "原来如此～。虽然要顾及这样的情况，\n但还是希望大家能度过一段愉快的时光……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1009_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "75c5dfd4057363c79803d7bf5bc286718061b553c6275b08b0b2c086f78ad468", "ja": "リアルに、ガチ寄りの好感度チェックを実施させて\nいただこう、と！　そういう番組でございます。", "zh": "这是一档请您进行一次贴近现实、相当认真的好感度测试的节目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "d184e655e0a1138924d95398948494c9bef5748e75d46ac947db01c6e6997bdf", "ja": "ガチの好感度チェックしながら\n楽しい時間にするって、難易度高くない？", "zh": "一边进行认真到不行的好感度测试，一边还要让大家度过愉快的时光，这难度不是很高吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "f2cb2b62474ceed5328272dc7abe295fd11e5f1fdf721b3acb5381e39d7a807d", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、恵美ちゃん！　あんまりにも\nガチ過ぎると、逆に笑えてくるから……！", "zh": "没事的，惠美！要是真的\n太较真了，反而会让人笑出来的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c95e81fcdb575de38d95eb1e62c4f6e445d8d05b011a97622bd681028f54407", "ja": "それって、ドーパミン的な感じのやつ？\nそこまでガチなの、これ？　何それ、怖……。", "zh": "这就是所谓多巴胺带来的感觉吗？\n这有那么认真吗？什么啊，好可怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1013_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "8728577d40fbe309ca05ce1706a3f2f193f57143c6efb3442f2ab104ed94f49a", "ja": "では、まずは小手調べという事で……お互い、\nどれだけ知ってる？　パーソナリティー・クイズ！", "zh": "那么，先来个热身……彼此之间，\n究竟了解多少？个性问答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "6ce94bd054131a5e1489647b26cf3bd00dad4024cf548b010e44811b75de59b0", "ja": "ワーッ！　パチパチパチ！", "zh": "哇——！啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1015_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "d4529e824a213ed60dc8c1254fffc52897de401bfddad61b2f11d12ff8ed1a8e", "ja": "絆で結ばれた劇場の仲間なら、答えられるはず……\nでは第1問、高山紗代子さんに関するクイズです！", "zh": "如果是由羁绊联系在一起的剧场伙伴，应该都能答出来……\n那么，下面是第1问，关于高山纱代子的问答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "9b59a36be193185ca70264572ca177e60a304fd1750368fea1eb9807253d1403", "ja": "わっ！？　は、はい！\nお手やわらかに、お願いします！", "zh": "哇！？在、在！\n还请手下留情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1017_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "8b73933872be4127ef8c32dced34105330c39f3d1f5690f0d94baeba5ad195e2", "ja": "たい焼きがお好きな事で有名な高山さんですが……\n食べる時は頭から？　それとも、尻尾から？", "zh": "以喜欢鲷鱼烧而闻名的高山小姐……  \n吃的时候是从头开始，还是从尾巴开始？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "8d61d429a71cffc1ae151e839c7b48f2b0e0656e3abd5150e2dae274acf4f6c9", "ja": "えっ！！？　た、食べてるとこは何回も見てるけど……\nどっちだっけ、ええと、ええと……！", "zh": "诶！！？虽、虽然看过你好几次吃鲷鱼烧的样子……\n到底是从头开始吃，还是从尾巴开始来着？呃、呃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "ce159ec179f360593b5ebb62a49d62fb671d8ee4e633ab326a93675e63699eb4", "ja": "待って待って、いきなりムズくない！？\n気にしたコトなかったな～……うーん……？", "zh": "等等等等，难度一下子就上来了吧！？\n我以前根本没注意过啊～……唔——……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1020_se", "source_sha256": "a16f32359232e64c0b33f24808ef1a9fda699a824a5bd5f385091d018e674e32", "ja": "ブブーッ！", "zh": "哔哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1021_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "c1d8286af1b2851c0d7a9817ab59598215ac3215c0d321a44f9f9cee0e642767", "ja": "残念、時間切れです！\n正解は……高山さん、どちらでしょう？", "zh": "很遗憾，时间到了！\n正确答案是……高山小姐，究竟是哪一个呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "a6d432a47ad98ebdaf525d8d56d5de31a2e8f4c0377aeddb23142d8f7cf6492f", "ja": "はい！　正解は、しっぽからです！", "zh": "是的！正确答案是，从尾巴开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1023_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "0929a370c326ab9513ee6ff560b7e09a8eb30fa8006124e73a72fe5fd9b54865", "ja": "おーっと、おふたりとも不正解！　仲間の事を\nよく知らないなんて……これは好感度ダウンですよ？", "zh": "哎呀——你们两位都答错了！连同伴都不了解……这样可是会降低好感度的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "3c35fd9f62135219a8baca22ff96c945e91751f3a8e252ae23c5e317ea6f7eb8", "ja": "いや言い方！？　司会者ちゃんのその言い方、\nわざと好感度下げようとしてるよね、それ！", "zh": "不是，这说法也太过分了吧！？主持人，你故意想降低好感度的吧！肯定是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1025_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "d1fc2a0931f6fddf66953df7420196954208bfa1b988f6ac53bcde79177ecdcc", "ja": "お次は、所恵美さんの問題です！　所さんがドリンク\nバーで作るスペシャルドリンクの、中身は何でしょう？", "zh": "接下来是所惠美先生的问题！所小姐在饮料吧制作的特制饮料，里面是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "000f3216cc0a2555952f93e593ff50a77f6b0f400c509850b8b5d1e20d137bd5", "ja": "あっ、あの変わった色のドリンクのことかな？\n確か、メロンとオレンジと……。", "zh": "啊，是指那杯颜色很奇怪的饮料吗？\n我记得，是哈密瓜、橙子，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "d02573cb8de6ddaec71e88e01057e029f965513d3601f2bf85b62d0612b15d28", "ja": "あと、なんか乳酸菌のヤツ！\nそれと……なんかもう1個入ってた気が……？", "zh": "还有，某种乳酸菌的东西！\n再加上……总觉得好像还加了1种……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1028_se", "source_sha256": "a16f32359232e64c0b33f24808ef1a9fda699a824a5bd5f385091d018e674e32", "ja": "ブブーッ！", "zh": "哔哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1029_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "c1efe8c285d1e4a03b75e3be50758545758d416c9965954749dad909bc914019", "ja": "こちらも時間切れです！\n正解は……所さん！", "zh": "这题也超时了！\n正确答案是……所小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "04c9905cc901a231a571f1f941b9aedefdd216d1da54ce20031b18789aedc23a", "ja": "えっと～、メロンとオレンジと、乳酸菌のと……\n最後は、白ぶどうね！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "呃～，哈密瓜、橙子，还有乳酸菌的……\n最后是白葡萄！喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1031_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "404f325d305b0c421fa0283b8cd3e4fe62bdc50229fc7946fcb7bfa2b621c764", "ja": "こちらも不正解！　ちょっと皆さん、\n長い付き合いだというのに、関心がないんですかぁ？", "zh": "这边也是错误答案！真是的，各位，\n都相处这么久了，难道一点兴趣都没有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1032_audience", "source_sha256": "b32eb222c01ae69ff4d693788b1aa64c3b86c758ccd4037fac3db0357dbe3014", "ja": "ドッ！　ワハハハハ……。", "zh": "咚！哇哈哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "dbda8fc4969e13dea60ded5180fe2965fe0c69f222eda4173f1c448bd8220161", "ja": "そ、そうじゃないんですけど！\nうぅ、結構マニアックな問題が出てくるね……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的！\n呜，问题还真是挺冷门的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1034_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "30b6ef4856e1cdb09c7b14da10c7bda75aa87e6c1952879972fbb188b5581a0e", "ja": "次、野々原さん！　野々原さんと言えばプリンですが\n……日本に初めてプリンがやってきたのは、何年？", "zh": "接下来，野野原小姐！说到野野原小姐就是布丁，不过……\n布丁最初传入日本是在几几年？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "824e7b97b949bc6e6af4d4e8a34d6b22587c79177a30936b6c9d3a9d0a0b98d1", "ja": "それ茜ちゃん関係ないよね！？\nただのプリンに関するクイズだよね！？　ギニャーッ！", "zh": "这和小茜没关系吧！？  \n只是关于布丁的问答吧！？　呀啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "c8f3d4ae3976ad8160ceade8b88db1812a7ffb6fdb9c6d8b026285c80000cefc", "ja": "おーいみんな、お疲れ様！\nディレクターさんが、ちょっとご挨拶したいって。", "zh": "喂——大家，辛苦了！\n导演说想来跟大家打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1038_director", "source_sha256": "a0228ed0fb582c6fb1570e55e7da12ae0f6f70ea11704eea8a223a73bc4d1097", "ja": "どもども！　お疲れちゃんした！", "zh": "多谢多谢！辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1042_director", "source_sha256": "b2e2765fcbacf7a5731353490584437f83e2083e55cefde6b025c76424d42c61", "ja": "ガーサス、765プロのドルアイちゃん達ですわコレ！\nジーマーでペッカンした！　アザス！", "zh": "真不愧是765位专业偶像啊这！  \n真的震撼到我了！谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "a84383316fc2dd0bf98563a1bd7e846b6ff77c3d830ace80b59ed6644f5d8cb5", "ja": "えっ、あ、ええと……？", "zh": "诶，啊，那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae34de523c87db09b082472811a4767cd068219637dc4539e14e02eadabb25b0", "ja": "ちょ、茜、なんて言ってるの？", "zh": "等等，茜，你在说什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "666dc00ba8dd59248f2bfb2269c34b05492e78af375668749947145d584200ba", "ja": "い、いやいやいや！　これは茜ちゃんも\n守備範囲の外、隣の駅くらい向こう側だよ……！？", "zh": "不、不是不是不是！这已经超出小茜的\n守备范围，远到隔壁车站去了吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "a297ddce145159af5ebcb54e53ad757ec8214bb6007383c893512e18b26873ee", "ja": "流石、765プロのアイドルさん達ですね！　マジで\n完璧でした！　ありがとうございました！　だって。", "zh": "不愧是765位专业偶像啊！真的\n太完美了！谢谢你们！——人家是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1048_023aka", "source_sha256": "7429024a8aa3b3c57b056e0ac95933f8568f804adff63bf229d48ad6f59b83ba", "ja": "まさか{$P$}ちゃんが、\nこの手の業界喋りについて行けるとは……！？", "zh": "真没想到{$P$}\n居然能跟上这种圈内黑话……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "e10b4af013946fbf4cb31f0d252660cfc548b7a77eadcc185fc65dfde6183555", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？　ありがとうございます！\n次も頑張りますから、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？谢谢您！\n下次我也会努力的，请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1050_director", "source_sha256": "5a04cd316cba20b5635ef7edb8dfc2e7e854f39d7ed857b401dd148d69470171", "ja": "ウィス！　これジースー取れると思うんで、\nテンアゲでシクヨロ！　それじゃ、失礼シャス！", "zh": "哟！我觉得用这个应该能订到寿司，所以请保持超嗨状态，多多关照！那我先告辞啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_01_1051_p", "source_sha256": "7cadc212ce6d29a1bb5afaf1437c5f119c783c9171524b01aec4b5806fb03b79", "ja": "（企画第1回目撮影は、こうして無事に終了した。\nしかし、ファンのみんなの反応が気になるな……）", "zh": "（企划第1次拍摄就这样顺利结束了。不过，真让人在意粉丝们的反应啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
